alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/BATTLE_SYSTEM.md` (primitives and gotchas) before editing.

- Build moves from the existing primitives: `ST.play` timelines, `ST.keys`, `ST.fly`, `RFX.scene` layers, `landHit`, `E2.apply`. Do not invent a new animation system.
- Real canvas coordinates are 576 x 324. Test with 3 monsters and with 2, and with 3 and 4 party members.
- Keep the hit timing: an `'hf'` (High-Five window) step at the impact, `landHit(100)` at the impact.
- Every move keeps its own spoken line key in `data/lines.js`. New move means new line, silent until Tom bakes it; log it in `docs/CHANGES.md` under "Lines to bake".
- The on-screen 3x5 font has no slash and no curly apostrophe; use a straight `'`.
- Test: `python3 tools/kit_test.py <character> --only=<move_key> --speed2` and look at the contact sheet in `tools/shots/`.
